          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "The circus is in town and Greta is learning to juggle…oranges! She and Sunny spend another vivid day in the garden learning all about orange fruits and veggies: carrots, sweet potatoes, oranges and more. Spider, Worm and Butterfly tell the story of “The Hidden Surprise”, they learn how to make Crunchy Carrot and Orange Salad, and they close out their fun-filled day with a game of “Orange or Not Orange.”",
